WEBVTT

00:17:29.329 --> 00:17:31.704
and they essentially put
it out there that, hey,

00:17:31.704 --> 00:17:35.038
if you can figure out how to balance
your school schedule with work,

00:17:35.038 --> 00:17:36.163
we'd love to keep you on.

00:17:36.954 --> 00:17:39.871
So Mandela started working at a
trading desk during the day

00:17:39.871 --> 00:17:44.538
and attending college at night. He's now
been with the firm for almost 30 years.

00:17:45.079 --> 00:17:48.913
And it all goes back to that first high
school internship when his colleagues

00:17:48.913 --> 00:17:50.996
saw his potential and helped
him achieve it.

00:17:51.621 --> 00:17:55.496
The guy who hired me on the desk
was still a very dear friend

00:17:55.496 --> 00:17:56.996
and mentor of mine to this day,

00:17:57.371 --> 00:18:00.788
and he was pretty hands on in terms
of helping to coach and mentor